'''Longs''' is a small [[Unincorporated area|unincorporated community]] in [[Horry County, South Carolina|Horry County]], [[South Carolina]], United States. It lies north of [[Myrtle Beach, South Carolina|Myrtle Beach]], located at the intersection of [[South Carolina Highway 9|S.C. 9]] and [[South Carolina Highway 905|S.C. 905]].

==History==
Of historical note, Longs became established when the Long family, who still have descendants living in South Carolina, [[California]], [[North Carolina]], and [[New York (state)|New York]], began the construction of many public buildings and works including a Baptist church.<ref>{{cite web |title=Company Profile |url=https://www.jdlongmasonry.com/wp/profiles/ |website=JD Long Masonry a full service masonry contractor |access-date=7 February 2024 |date=28 October 2013}}</ref> The family moved into the construction and masonry industries with corporations such as JD Long Masonry and Long Enterprises stretching far along the east coast of the United States.

